<title>UK: James Capel offers UK election night share service.</title>
<headline>James Capel offers UK election night share service.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>HSBC James Capel  on Tuesday joined the list of London broking houses planning to keep their equity operations open through the night of the UK election this Thursday.</p>
<p>Capel said its equity market-making and sales trading desks would be staffed thoughout the night, in order to provide a share dealing service to clients.</p>
<p>Rival brokerages Merrill Lynch and NatWest Securities have already said they will keep their equity desks open through Thursday night.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
